'''Shock Trooper''' is a [[Warframe Augment Mod]] for {{WF|Volt}} that allows {{A|Shock}} to be held on cast, creating a wave of energy traveling outward from the user that temporarily grants the caster and nearby allies additional {{D|Electricity}} damage to all attacks.<section end=intro />

