==Acquisition==
*This mod can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''Maxim''' under the {{Faction|Arbiters of Hexis}}, or the rank of '''Exalted''' under the {{Faction|Red Veil}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
*Damage bonus is affected by [[Ability Strength]].
*Duration is affected by [[Ability Duration]].
*Range is affected by [[Ability Range]].
*Adds {{D|Electricity}} damage to weapon attacks. This damage bonus does '''not''' combine with other elements, and is '''additive''' with elemental mods.
*Multiple Shock Troopers do not stack; the buff with the highest Ability Strength will take effect.
**However if a weaker buff with more Ability Duration is cast, it will take effect after the stronger buff expires.
*Electric damage from weapons buffed by Shock Trooper does not activate the passive from {{M|Archon Stretch}}.
*Does not apply to [[Archguns]].
*Does not apply to [[Exalted Weapon]].

